A '''Heavy Weighted Pressure Plate''' is a {{Common}} [[Vanilla Objects/Redstone-Related Blocks|Redstone-related]] block that can be used on the player's {{Zone|Private Island}}.

== Obtaining ==
=== Crafting ===
{{Crafting Recipe Table
|{{Crafting Recipe Row
 |A2 = Iron Ingot |B2 = Iron Ingot
 |Output = Heavy Weighted Pressure Plate
}}
}}

=== Shop Purchase ===
A '''Heavy Weighted Pressure Plate''' can be purchased from the {{NPCSprite|Mad Redstone Engineer}} for {{Coins|12}}.

== Usage ==
=== Private Island ===
'''Heavy Weighted Pressure Plates''' can be placed as a block on the player's {{Zone|Private Island}} or plots in {{Zone|The Garden}}. Its [[mcw:Pressure Plate#Usage|functionality]] only work on the {{Zone|Private Island}}, but there are [[Private Island#Redstone Restrictions|restrictions]] on how often it can be used. Redstone is disabled on {{Zone|The Garden}}.

